#
# Percentiles: the order statistics of values with ties, zeros of both signs, infinities and NaN, at
# fixed percentiles, between two of them and on one, and at percentiles the point gives, valid or
# not -- the same bits on every backend.
in p, a, b, c, d, e
def q = abs(p) * 25
out median = percentile(50, a, b, c, d, e)
out even = percentile(50, a, b, c, d)
out quartile = percentile(25, a, b, c, d, e)
out third = percentile(33.3, a, b, c, d, e, a, b)
out least = percentile(0, a, b, c)
out most = percentile(100, a, b, c)
out given = percentile(q, a, b, c, d, e)
out raw = percentile(p, a, b, c)
out single = percentile(q, a)
out zeros = percentile(25, a, -0, -0)
